      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CREAM (4) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into third last time out (20.48) over 350m at this track. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. SOMERTON ANN (2) turned in a better effort at Warragul last start, finishing second behind Lady Persimmon (23.10) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from nine starts. Bold showing expected. PETITE BEAST (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (20.66) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has the ability to give this a shake. PLAYBACK (6) is a last-start placegetter in a tight finish – sure to have admirers.",
